  "releaseNotes": "2.0 targets the latest .NET only (net11.0); apps on .NET 8, 9 or 10 stay on 1.x. New: streaming requests with MediatR's API (IStreamRequest, IStreamRequestHandler, IStreamPipelineBehavior, CreateStream), and no package dependencies. The API is otherwise unchanged from 1.3. See CHANGELOG.md.",
